Description: Remove ui/gfx/ipc/skia dependency removed in Chromium 145
 Chromium 145 removed the ui/gfx/ipc/skia/ directory and its BUILD.gn
 target entirely. CEF's BUILD.gn still referenced this dependency,
 causing gn gen to fail with "Unable to load ui/gfx/ipc/skia/BUILD.gn".
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <juan.mendezr@proton.me>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-02-16

diff --git a/cef/BUILD.gn b/cef/BUILD.gn
index 0913450..e3d218f 100644
--- a/cef/BUILD.gn
+++ b/cef/BUILD.gn
@@ -998,7 +998,6 @@ source_set("libcef_static") {
     "//ui/gfx/geometry",
     "//ui/gfx/ipc",
     "//ui/gfx/ipc/geometry",
-    "//ui/gfx/ipc/skia",
     "//ui/gl",
     "//ui/strings",
     "//ui/views",
